Filename: /tmp/test/io_cmds.doc

This file is used to set up the mode and data sources for the io_test program. 

Field definitions:
	#1 = mode
    		i = interactive mode
		s = suppress cdb display in interactive mode
	        a = auto return mode (no command display or interaction)
	#2 = op code (* = default)     
	#3 = page code (* = default)
	#4 = command name
	#5 = file containing return data    
	#6 = file containing sense data

-a  12   *  "Inquiry"            "/tmp/test/inquiry.doc"   "/tmp/test/sense.doc"
-a  28   *  "Read"               "/tmp/test/read.doc"      "/tmp/test/sense.doc"
-a  25   *  "Read Capacity"      "/tmp/test/readcap.doc"   "/tmp/test/sense.doc"
-a  5a  01  "Mode Sense"         "/tmp/test/recovery.doc"  "/tmp/test/sense.doc"  
-a  5a  2a  "Mode Sense"         "/tmp/test/phyarray.doc"  "/tmp/test/sense.doc"
-a  5a  2b  "Mode Sense"         "/tmp/test/logarray.doc"  "/tmp/test/sense.doc" 
-a  2a   *  "Write"              ""                    "/tmp/test/sense.doc"
-a  3b   *  "Write Buffer"       ""                    "/tmp/test/sense.doc"
-a  55   *  "Mode Select"        ""                    "/tmp/test/sense.doc"
-a  1c   *  "Receive Diagnosis"  ""                    "/tmp/test/sense.doc"
-a  03   *  "Request Sense"      ""                    "/tmp/test/sense.doc"
-a  4c   *  "Log Select"         ""                    "/tmp/test/sense.doc"
-a  4d   *  "Log Sense"          ""                    "/tmp/test/sense.doc"
-a  2e   *  "Write and Verify"   ""                    "/tmp/test/sense.doc"
-a  2f   *  "Verify"             ""                    "/tmp/test/sense.doc"
-a  04   *  "Format"             ""                    ""
-a   *   *  "Unknown"            ""                    ""

